  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
    <sup style="font-size: 0.8em;">4</sup> Students are intended to complete the entire endorsement areas and could be a specific minor field outside of CAAD, open electives outside of CAAD, or open electives inside of CAAD. Between 21-30 hours are needed to complete the required 120 hours for the degree. Students will consult with the BA advisor when building their personalized curriculum.
